<p>Observers find it difficult to tell you and your shadows apart.</p><p>You can target a shadow in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 4, 8, 11, 15</acronym> and instantly trade places with it.</p><p><acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> random negative physical or magical effects are transferred from you to the chosen shadow in the process.</p>